      "summaries": {
        "en": "Granite-Timeseries-TTM-R1 is an open-source time series foundation model that enables accurate forecasting across diverse domains without extensive retraining. It employs the innovative TinyTimeMixer architecture, which efficiently captures temporal patterns through multi-scale mixing operations while maintaining computational efficiency. Researchers can fine-tune it on specific datasets for tasks like energy demand prediction or financial trend analysis, while developers can integrate it into applications requiring reliable time-aware insights.",
        "zh": "Granite-Timeseries-TTM-R1 是一个开源时间序列基础模型，能够跨多个领域进行准确预测而无需大量重新训练。它采用创新的 TinyTimeMixer 架构，通过多尺度混合操作高效捕捉时间模式，同时保持计算效率。该模型的核心优势在于其通用性和灵活性，研究人员可针对能源需求预测或金融趋势分析等任务进行微调，开发者则可将其集成到需要可靠时间感知能力的应用中，为实际场景提供持续的时间序列洞察。",
        "es": "Granite-Timeseries-TTM-R1 is an open-source time series foundation model that enables accurate forecasting across diverse domains without extensive retraining. It employs the innovative TinyTimeMixer architecture, which efficiently captures temporal patterns through multi-scale mixing operations while maintaining computational efficiency. Researchers can fine-tune it on specific datasets for tasks like energy demand prediction or financial trend analysis, while developers can integrate it into applications requiring reliable time-aware insights.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "granite-timeseries-ttm-r1 stands out for granite-tsfm, safetensors, and tinytimemixer in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Granite-Timeseries-TTM-R1 is an open-source time series foundation model that enables accurate forecasting across diverse domains without extensive retraining. It employs the innovative TinyTimeMixer architecture, which efficiently captures temporal patterns through multi-scale mixing operations while maintaining computational efficiency. Researchers can fine-tune it on specific datasets for tasks like energy demand prediction or financial trend analysis, while developers can integrate it into applications requiring reliable time-aware insights.",
          "how": "Review https://huggingface.co/ibm-granite/granite-timeseries-ttm-r1 for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
